Package: file-roller
Version: @DEB_FILE-ROLLER_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: X11/Wayland Apps
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://apps.gnome.org/FileRoller/
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libgtk-4-1, libadwaita-1-0, libarchive13, libjson-glib-1.0-0
Recommends: tar, gzip, xz, bzip2, unzip, zip
Description: File Roller (GNOME archive manager, GTK4)
 File Roller creates and extracts archives such as tar, gzip, xz, zip, 7z and
 more. The archive engine is libarchive; for formats libarchive does not cover
 it shells out to the matching command-line tools. GTK4/libadwaita, pure C.
